 "notes": "Availability zone names are not pinned; each subnet pair must span two zones. Public/private route tables are required as at least two route tables. Routing is checked per link (association to subnet, route to gateway), not per path: the interpreter's ref has one hop, so 'this subnet's table has this route' cannot be bound across association, table and route, and a template routing the wrong table to the wrong gateway is not caught."
